  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shock-Responsive Social Protection Climate Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen the Government of Mozambique&#x2019;s capability to engage with, shape and operationalise climate-financed shock-responsive social protection. It will provide technical assistance, institutional strengthening, learning and early pipeline development to support INAS, MTGAS and relevant stakeholders to improve preparedness, coordination and readiness for future climate finance mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
